media/meals/lgmnff1763789847.jpg','[DEMO] Illustrative kofta burgers photo (TheMealDB); not this vendor\'s dish.','2026-10-23 03:43:11'),(1846,13942,77,'https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rwuyqx1511383174.jpg','[DEMO] Illustrative Pancakes photo (TheMealDB); not this vendor\'s dish.','2026-10-23 03:43:11'),(1847,13942,77,'https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yypvst1511386427.jpg','[DEMO] Illustrative Chocolate Raspberry Brownies photo (TheMealDB); not this vendor\'s dish.','2026-10-23 03:43:11'),(1848,13952,77,'https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lgmnff1763789847.jpg','[DEMO] Generic illustrative food photo; not taken by a real customer.','2026-10-23 03:43:11'),(1861,13946,81,'https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lgmnff1763789847.jpg','[DEMO] Illustrative kofta burgers photo (TheMealDB); not this vendor\'s dish.','2026-10-23 03:43:11'),(1862,13946,81,'https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rwuyqx1511383174.jpg','[DEMO] Illustrative Pancakes photo (TheMealDB); not this vendor\'s dish.','2026-10-23 03:43:11'),(1863,13946,81,'https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yypvst1511386427.jpg','[DEMO] Illustrative Chocolate Raspberry Brownies photo (TheMealDB); not this vendor\'s dish.','2026-10-23 03:43:11'),(1864,13956,81,'https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lgmnff1763789847.jpg','[DEMO] Generic illustrative food photo; not taken by a real customer.','2026-10-23 03:43:11');
